WEBVTT

00:44:59.648 --> 00:45:02.495
but they don't know how to help.

00:45:03.405 --> 00:45:06.218
Do you have any thoughts
or wisdom to offer on that,

00:45:06.242 --> 00:45:08.285
having just experienced this?

00:45:08.309 --> 00:45:12.113
EG: I'm new in the game.
You know, it's not over. I'm in it now.

00:45:12.491 --> 00:45:15.704
I'm still in grief, you know?

00:45:16.516 --> 00:45:19.804
But I know this; this is what
it's teaching me about itself,

00:45:19.828 --> 00:45:22.344
and I'm a willing student.

00:45:22.368 --> 00:45:23.765
Um ...

00:45:25.369 --> 00:45:28.391
It happens upon you.

00:45:28.415 --> 00:45:29.595
It's bigger than you.

00:45:29.619 --> 00:45:33.235
There's a humility
that you have to step into,